[en.DECISION_WETM_MANIPULATE_BONDS]
Market Manipulation

[en.DECISION_WETM_MANIPULATE_BONDS_desc]
Manipulate the price of $WETM_DEV_BONDS$, boosting it for a short period.

[en.DECISION_WETM_MANIPULATE_BONDS_TOOLTIP]
During the decision activation period, $WETM_DEV_BONDS$ will appreciate, but will depreciate after the decision ends.

[zh.DECISION_WETM_MANIPULATE_BONDS]
市场操纵

[zh.DECISION_WETM_MANIPULATE_BONDS_desc]
操纵$WETM_DEV_BONDS$的价格，使其在短期内上涨。

[zh.DECISION_WETM_MANIPULATE_BONDS_TOOLTIP]
决议持续期间，$WETM_DEV_BONDS$将会升值，但在决议结束后将会贬值。
